# Route: guide 42 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Orc (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 59, 52
# quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thousand Needles, Badlands, Blasted Lands, Tanaris, Un'Goro Crater):
# Darkcloud Pinnacle -> The Shimmering Flats -> Agmond's End -> Angor Fortress
# -> Kargath -> The Dustbowl -> Kargath -> Dreadmaul Hold -> Serpent's Coil ->
# The Dark Portal -> Altar of Storms -> Nethergarde Keep -> Gadgetzan -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Arikara (5088; Arikara 28);
# Encrusted Tail Fins (1107; Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37,
# Saltscale Tide Lord 37, Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Gahz'rilla (2770), Find the Gems and Power Source (2339),
# Disharmony of Fire (3907), Commander Gor'shak (3981), The Rise of the
# Machines (4063), KILL ON SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves (4081), KILL ON SIGHT:
# High Ranking Dark Iron Officials (4082), Operation: Death to Angerforge
# (4132), Lost Thunderbrew Recipe (4134), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), The Pack
# Mistress (4724), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729), The Darkstone Tablet (4768),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862), Warlord's Command (4903), Operative Bijou (4981),
# Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll Temper (3042), Into the
# Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527),
# The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets (4788).

